                                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                                    "patching_rect": [ 6.0, 67.0, 315.0, 248.0 ],
                                                    "text": "A Signed Distance Function engine from the glCore examples.\nAdapted from Inigo Quilez's work:\nhttps://www.iquilezles.org/www/articles/distfunctions/distfunctions.htm\n\neven if it looks 3d the output is actually a 2d texture, that is why there is a ste.3dLayer connected at the bottom\n\nthink of it as a self contained 3d renderer that outputs the final texture\n\nthere are parameters about the rendering and engine quality for the SDF algorthms\n\nvirtual camera / POV rotation around the center \n\nand light parameters"
                                                }
